OL,3,GNEWSABilly Monger urges the young to
OL,4,Aovercome self-doubt
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Social media could lead to doubtful
OL,7,Fself-comparisons," says Billy Monger -
OL,8,Fa man who has overcome seemingly
OL,9,Finsurmountable challenges before
OL,10,Fbecoming a sporting champion.
OL,12,FThe TV presenter and former racing
OL,13,Fdriver from Charlwood in Surrey broke
OL,14,Fthe Ironman record in 2024 after having
OL,15,Fboth legs amputated following a
OL,16,Fnear-fatal crash in 2017.
OL,18,FHe now wants to offer the younger
OL,19,Fgeneration tips on overcoming life's
OL,20,Fobstacles.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
